{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nVienna tonight was a spectacle. The Emperor’s name day brought the whole city to the Italian Opera. I sat amidst the full house, listening to twenty-nine singers—including Rubini and Lablache—strike the anthem in perfect unison. It is a striking display of disciplined harmony, a collective will sublimated into art.\n\nThe rain kept the streets dark, sparing us the usual illuminations, which suited my preference for the interior over the exterior. We also saw a German cast premiere an Auber opera. The music was pleasant, but the Italian voices hold a certain natural grace that the German ones, however skilled, lack.\n\nI am well, though my luggage has already departed, leaving me lighter for the journey. I think of you and the boys. The world moves, but my heart remains in Berlin.\n\nYour devoted\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795080295,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":184,"prompt_tokens":949,"total_tokens":1133,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-qQHKsCO117UDQO80iFnGVu2ovoIWblxU","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":949,"prompt_ms":1000.287,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0540432033719704,"prompt_per_second":948.7277151457531,"predicted_n":184,"predicted_ms":4438.823,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.255863387978145,"predicted_per_second":41.22714512383125}}